flowchart TB
accTitle: Submission acceptance and grading completion happen at different times
accDescr: The API acknowledges only after SQS accepts a submission. Bounded Lambda workers persist results to DynamoDB, while the mobile client separately downloads cached images through CloudFront from S3.
M[Mobile client]:::inputData --> A[Submission API]:::process
A -->|Durable enqueue| Q[(SQS submissions)]:::storage
Q -.->|Acceptance receipt via API| M
Q --> W[Lambda workers<br/>Bounded concurrency]:::process
W --> D[(DynamoDB results<br/>Idempotent submission IDs)]:::storage
M --> C[CloudFront image cache]:::process
C -->|Cache miss| S[(S3 exam images)]:::storage
